 "subject": "Moderated-mediator Path Analysis",
 "messages_listed": 3,
 "last_activity": "2017-03-24T00:21:41Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "MkaGtxmGBAAJ",
   "from": "chaop...@gmail.com",
   "author": "632b2e985c616b1e",
   "date": "2017-03-20T08:32:27Z",
   "subject": "Moderated-mediator Path Analysis",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>library(lavaan)                                                                 </div><div>pathdata &lt;- read.table(&quot;<a href=\"http://www.statmodel.com/usersguide/chap3/ex3.8a.dat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.statmodel.com/usersguide/chap3/ex3.8a.dat&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371702000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CdjlPs9OM0XF03NklHgLP\">http://www.statmodel.com/usersguide/chap3/ex3.8a.dat</a>&quot;)                                            <br></div><div>names(pathdata) &lt;-c(&quot;y&quot;,&quot;m&quot;,&quot;x&quot;,&quot;z&quot;)                                            </div><div>attach(pathdata)                                                                </div><div>pathdata$xz &lt;- (x-mean(x))*(z-mean(z))                                          </div><div>pathmodel &lt;- &#39; m ~ x +z + xz                                                    </div><div>               y ~ x +z + m+ xz&#39;</div><div>pathfit &lt;- sem(pathmodel, pathdata)                                             </div><div>summary(pathfit,fit.measures=&quot;TRUE&quot;)                                            </div><div>fitMeasures(pathfit,fit.measures=&quot;all&quot;, baseline.model=NULL)                    </div><div>standardizedSolution(pathfit)     </div><div><br></div><div>This is the first to use lavaan. Please help to check whether the syntax is correct or not? Thanks.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "EBXoe_D3BAAJ",
   "from": "Terrence Jorgensen",
   "author": "3fe90052fbf2f899",
   "date": "2017-03-21T19:18:34Z",
   "subject": "Re: Moderated-mediator Path Analysis",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>whether the syntax is correct or not? </div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Looks correct, does it work?  Two notes:</div><div><ul><li>There is no need to mean-center your predictors, but if you insist on doing so, you should be consistent and use the mean-centered predictors x and z in addition to the product of the mean-centered variables. Otherwise your interpretation is messed up by the not being able to hold x (or z) constant at a particular level (e.g., 0 would be &quot;at the mean&quot; for the product term, but actually zero for the simple effect).</li><li>As far as I know, the standardized solution will <b><i>not</i></b> result in correct standardized coefficients because lavaan must assume &quot;xz&quot; is a variable all its own, not a product of 2 other variables.  To get correct standardized coefficients, manually save standardized versions of your variables in the data set, calculate the product term from those, then fit the model to the standardized data (pay attention only to the coefficients, which will be standardized; pay no attention to the <i>SE</i>s or significance tests).</li></ul></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">pathdata$x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">st </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pathdata$x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>pathdata$m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">st </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pathdata$m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>pathdata$y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">st </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pathdata$y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>pathdata$z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">st </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pathdata$z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>pathdata$xz</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">st </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pathdata$x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">st </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pathdata$z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">st<br><br>stmodel </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39; <a href=\"http://m.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://m.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26NVUpFW7MOZVzBBdroLbR\">m.st</a> ~ <a href=\"http://x.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://x.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QHpGSInVqEOhZUoXUGguA\">x.st</a> + <a href=\"http://z.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://z.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00NQLU01rDm4i6BliElpS0\">z.st</a> + <a href=\"http://xz.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://xz.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21w1bsJda8lM6iB9iENkoH\">xz.st</a>                                                    <br>             <a href=\"http://y.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://y.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3r1uGIJIajOCNPjJPosdMV\">y.st</a> ~ <a href=\"http://x.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://x.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QHpGSInVqEOhZUoXUGguA\">x.st</a> + <a href=\"http://z.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://z.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00NQLU01rDm4i6BliElpS0\">z.st</a> + <a href=\"http://m.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://m.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26NVUpFW7MOZVzBBdroLbR\">m.st</a> + <a href=\"http://xz.st\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://xz.st&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21w1bsJda8lM6iB9iENkoH\">xz.st</a> &#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>stpathfit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stmodel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pathdata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>coef</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stpathfit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># standardized coefficients</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div>UvA web page: <a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427371703000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3e6ClnzelvUwp1DC1I-9yD\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
